# Every Alliance flight path in the Eastern Kingdoms, from Stormwind and Ironforge out to the level 60
# zones, roughly in the order of the zones' levels. Polestar knows which flight paths a character has,
# so each step a character already has is passed over: the tour always picks up at the first flight
# path still missing.
#
# The flight points and their flight masters come from Polestar's reference data. Farholde Keep in the
# Riverglades is WoW Forever's own: Polestar's data has it since 0.4.0, and it still names its flight
# master (npc). No `next`: an import string may only lead on to a guide the player already imported,
# so each tour ends on its own and its last step points to the other continent's.

guide flight-path-collector/alliance-eastern-kingdoms
title Flight Paths: Eastern Kingdoms (Alliance)
faction Alliance
category Exploration
folder Flight paths
levels 1-60
zone map 1415
keywords flight path, flight paths, flight point, flight points, flight master, gryphon, FP, taxi, Riverglades
why Every flight path you learn is a walk you never make again, and the tour skips the ones you already have.
version 2

step Stormwind
  zone Stormwind City
  tip The human capital, in the north-west of Elwynn Forest.
  getfp "Stormwind"

step Sentinel Hill
  zone Westfall
  tip The People's Militia's stronghold in the middle of Westfall (levels 10-20), west of Elwynn Forest.
  getfp "Sentinel Hill"

step Darkshire
  zone Duskwood
  tip The town in the east of Duskwood (levels 18-30), south of Elwynn Forest.
  getfp "Darkshire"

step Lakeshire
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip The town by the lake in the Redridge Mountains (levels 15-25), east of Elwynn Forest.
  getfp "Lakeshire"

step Ironforge
  zone Ironforge
  tip The dwarven capital in Dun Morogh. From Stormwind the Deeprun Tram takes you there under the mountains.
  getfp "Ironforge"

step Thelsamar
  zone Loch Modan
  tip The dwarven town in the west of Loch Modan (levels 10-20), east of Dun Morogh.
  getfp "Thelsamar"

step Menethil Harbor
  zone Wetlands
  tip The port on the west coast of the Wetlands (levels 20-30), north of Loch Modan through Dun Algaz. Its boats sail to Theramore, Southshore and Auberdine.
  getfp "Menethil Harbor"

step Southshore
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip The town on the coast of Hillsbrad Foothills (levels 20-30). The boat from Menethil Harbor lands here.
  getfp "Southshore"

step Refuge Pointe
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip The League of Arathor's camp in the middle of the Arathi Highlands (levels 30-40), east of Hillsbrad.
  getfp "Refuge Pointe"

step Farholde Keep
  zone Riverglades
  tip The Alliance keep in the south of the Riverglades, WoW Forever's own zone east of Redridge (levels 36-44). The step ticks itself when Gretchen Mayberry's flight map opens (with a Polestar older than 0.4, tick it off yourself).
  getfp "Farholde Keep" npc 257087

step Booty Bay
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The goblin port at the southern tip of Stranglethorn Vale (levels 30-45), with a flight master for each faction. The road south from Duskwood crosses the whole jungle; the boat from Ratchet lands here too.
  getfp "Booty Bay"

step Aerie Peak
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip The Wildhammer dwarves' stronghold in the west of the Hinterlands (levels 40-50), where the road from Hillsbrad Foothills comes in.
  getfp "Aerie Peak"

step Thorium Point
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip The Thorium Brotherhood's camp on the north-west rim of the Searing Gorge (levels 43-50). The trail into the Gorge climbs up from the western Badlands close to Kargath, a Horde outpost: mind its guards.
  getfp "Thorium Point"

step Nethergarde Keep
  zone Blasted Lands
  tip The keep in the north of the Blasted Lands (levels 45-55), south of the Swamp of Sorrows.
  getfp "Nethergarde Keep"

step Morgan's Vigil
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip The Alliance camp in the east of the Burning Steppes (levels 50-58), just west of Redridge.
  getfp "Morgan's Vigil"

step Chillwind Camp
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip The Alliance camp in the south of the Western Plaguelands (levels 51-58), north of Hillsbrad Foothills.
  getfp "Chillwind Camp"

step Light's Hope Chapel
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip The Argent Dawn's chapel at the east end of the Eastern Plaguelands (levels 53-60). The road east from the Western Plaguelands crosses the zone. It is the last Alliance flight path in the Eastern Kingdoms: for the other continent, open Flight Paths: Kalimdor (Alliance).
  getfp "Light's Hope Chapel"
